  "contract": "Starburst (284221) is a Hero spell; its stacks come from the Starburst Barrage passives. Spell.dbc gives the rank 284222 and the Mystic Enchant rank 979137 a PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL effect, chance 100, with family 7 class mask 4, the family mask of Starfire (8950), triggering 284220 (stack 3) and 979138 (stack 4), whose effects add 0.5 s to Starburst. Their DBC ProcFlags 16 only match melee-class spell hits while Starfire is a magic-class damage spell, so the generated proc never fired. A level 40 Hero with both passives casts Starfire at a dummy twice: each Barrage aura must gain one stack per cast. Issue #10722.",
